abstract: >-
  This lesson introduces the fundamental concepts of machine learning (ML) and
  its applications in geospatial data analysis. It covers the basics of ML
  algorithms, basics of geospatial data, and models, providing learners with
  practical skills to apply ML methods to geospatial datasets.
